# Secrets ([product name])
#
# This file names each secret and where its value lives.
# It holds no secret value. Do not paste a key, token, password, or connection string here.
# Keep real values in the store named on each line (for example a local env file that git ignores,
# or the host's secret manager).
#
# Format: NAME | where the value lives | who uses it
#
# DATABASE_URL | {local env file or secret manager} | {service}
# {SECRET_NAME} | {where the value lives} | {service}
